# Class: obo:OCCO_00000118 (credential)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:OCCO_00000118 "A document issued by a third party recognized as bearing the relevant authority to do so, that is designed to be about an entity's competence, qualifications, or authority.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:OCCO_00000118 "Bill Duncan")
