# Class: obo:OCCO_00000127 (credential grantor role)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:OCCO_00000127 "A role borne by an organization that has been accredited by a quality assurance group through a deontic declaration having action regulation output, which authorizes the organization to bestow credentials according to quality control standards established or enforced by the accrediting group.")
